(
    title: "Spinning Fireball",
    description: Some("The player is a wizard who winds up a spinning fireball, holding it to build rotation before loosing it at the enemy catapult across the field — the direction of spin bends the shot\'s flight path. Landing a hit clears the level, while a fireball that ricochets back, the catapult\'s return fire, or the ever-shrinking time limit each cost a life."),
